    "finalText": "Implementation complete and verified. The API passes all 61 checks (status codes, exact bodies, 409/422/404 error fields, atomic click counting, ordering), plus restart persistence, pristine-DB boot, and a confirmed `0.0.0.0:8000` bind.\n\n- **Stack**: ASP.NET Core 8 + EF Core/Npgsql (idiomatic persistence), `DATABASE_URL` parsed from env into an Npgsql connection string — no hard-coded credentials.\n- **Endpoints**: `POST /links` (201/409/422), `GET /links/{code}` (200/404), `GET /r/{code}` (302 + `ExecuteUpdateAsync` atomic increment), `GET /links` (ascending creation order, `total`).\n- **`start.sh`**: builds, applies pending migrations via `dotnet …UrlShortener.dll migrate`, then `exec`s the app on `0.0.0.0:8000` (overriding the image's `ASPNETCORE_HTTP_PORTS=8080`), so kills release the port cleanly.\n- **README** documents `sh start.sh`. DB left empty with schema applied, server stopped — ready for the test suite."
